From a497ff278d40af332a5797912da5307c49fd78f7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 06:32:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] WIP: F-219 - zepnav Detour helper, move path/path_to/ground,
 cast, test scripts

- zeppelin/nav/zepnav.cpp: Detour queries on AzerothCore mmaps, built against
  Zeppelin-Core's vendored Detour (DT_POLYREF64); MmapTileHeader v19 mirrored; lazy tile
  loading around each route; PathGenerator settings (extents 3/5/3 then 3/50/3,
  GROUND|WATER|MAGMA, recast y,z,x); line protocol path/height
- move: shared waypoint walker; move.path (waypoints only), move.path_to (walk, 25 s budget
  per call, remaining/partial reported), move.ground; installer builds zepnav next to move
- interact: cast RPC (CMSG_CAST_SPELL, SPELL_GO / CAST_FAILED / SPELL_FAILURE), use
  spell_id for locked chests
- zeppelin/tests: rpc.py helper + valley_of_trials.py end-to-end test
- verified live: valley_of_trials PASS in 10.7 s (DB: 4641 rewarded, 788 in progress, 50 XP);
  Den -> Razor Hill 1432 yd / 32 waypoints walked in 214 s, DB saved the exact target

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SQmFdwZBdZ1kNkYTTF4JNJ
